description:
Run `pnpm update -r` to move all ~12 in-range deps to the newest version allowed by
their existing semver ranges. No manifest edits expected.

Targets: @radix-ui/react-label 2.1.8->2.1.15, @tailwindcss/vite 4.3.0->4.3.3,
@tanstack/react-router 1.170.17->1.170.39, @tanstack/react-router-devtools 1.167.0->1.167.2,
@tanstack/react-router-ssr-query 1.167.1->1.167.3, @tanstack/react-start 1.168.27->1.168.58,
@testing-library/dom 10.4.1->10.4.2, @testing-library/react 16.3.2->16.3.3,
@testing-library/user-event 14.6.1->14.6.7, react-i18next 17.0.8->17.0.15,
tailwindcss 4.3.0->4.3.3, @typescript/native-preview (catalog) 20260514.1->20260707.2.

IMPORTANT: this runs FIRST, before the clients/start i18n work, so that work is written
against the newest i18next/react-i18next in-range API and does not need rework.

Verify: pnpm install succeeds, lint:types clean, and no new failures appear.
This is part of epic "Update all dependencies including major versions".
